config BR2_PACKAGE_ADCDEMO_UI
    bool "adcdemo ui"
    select BR2_PACKAGE_BEAGLEVFIRE_ADCDEMO
    select BR2_PACKAGE_SAMPLER_GATEWARE
    select BR2_PACKAGE_SAMPLER_NET
    select BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3
    select BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_AIOHTTP
    select BR2_PACKAGE_BUSYBOX_SHOW_OTHERS
    select BR2_PACKAGE_COREUTILS
    select BR2_PACKAGE_HOST_NODEJS_BIN
    help
      UIO based ADC demo UI: aiohttp server (reads the mvaring shared
      memory ring written by bvf_adc_stream) and the React front-end.

      Mutually exclusive with the IIO based BR2_PACKAGE_SAMPLER (and
      its sampler-ui): those packages are hidden when this is enabled.
